#: kcmlaunch.cpp:47
msgid ""
"<h1>Launch Feedback</h1> You can configure the application-launch feedback "
"here."
msgstr "<h1>लाँच फीडबैक</h1> एतय अहाँ एप्लीकेशन-लांच फीडबैक कान्फिगरेशन कए सकैत छी."

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:50
msgid "Bus&y Cursor"
msgstr "व्यस्त संकेतक"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:52
msgid ""
"<h1>Busy Cursor</h1>\n"
"KDE offers a busy cursor for application startup notification.\n"
"To enable the busy cursor, select one kind of visual feedback\n"
"from the combobox.\n"
"It may occur, that some applications are not aware of this startup\n"
"notification. In this case, the cursor stops blinking after the time\n"
"given in the section 'Startup indication timeout'"
msgstr ""
"व्यस्त संकेतक<h1>Busy Cursor</h1>\n"
"केडीई प्रस्तुत करैत अछि एकटा व्यस्त संकेतक- अनुप्रयोग प्रारंभ करब केर संबंधमे बताबै क'लेल.\n"
" व्यस्त संकेतक सक्षम करब क' लेल एकटा प्रकार क' विजुअल फीडबैक\n"
"काम्बो बक्सामे सँ चुनू.\n"
"एहन भ' सकैत अछि जे किछु अनुप्रयोग एहि विशेषता- प्रारंभ करए केर संबंधमे बताबै क' लेल- "
"अनभिज्ञ हुए\n"
". एहन परिस्थितिमे, कर्सर टिमटिमओनाइ बन्न कए देत अछि\n"
" 'स्टार्टअप इंडीकेशन टाइमआउट' मे देल गेल समय केर उपरांत."

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:68
msgid "No Busy Cursor"
msgstr "अव्यस्त संकेतक"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:69
msgid "Passive Busy Cursor"
msgstr "अक्रिय व्यस्त संकेतक "

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:70
msgid "Blinking Cursor"
msgstr "टिमटिमाबैत संकेतक"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:71
msgid "Bouncing Cursor"
msgstr "उछलैत संकेतक"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:78
msgid "&Startup indication timeout:"
msgstr "स्टार्टअप इंडीकेशन टाइमआउटः"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:82 kcmlaunch.cpp:114
msgid " sec"
msgstr " sec"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:87
msgid "Taskbar &Notification"
msgstr "काजपट्टी अधिसूचना"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:88
msgid ""
"<H1>Taskbar Notification</H1>\n"
"You can enable a second method of startup notification which is\n"
"used by the taskbar where a button with a rotating hourglass appears,\n"
"symbolizing that your started application is loading.\n"
"It may occur, that some applications are not aware of this startup\n"
"notification. In this case, the button disappears after the time\n"
"given in the section 'Startup indication timeout'"
msgstr ""

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:103
msgid "Enable &taskbar notification"
msgstr "काज पट्टी सक्षम करू"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:110
msgid "Start&up indication timeout:"
msgstr "स्टार्टअप इंडीकेशन टाइमआउटः"
